# Keep the Docker build context small and correct. node_modules is installed
# fresh by `npm ci` in the builder stage; shipping the host copy would bloat the
# context and — worse — drop host-arch native binaries (esbuild/rollup) into a
# Linux image via `COPY . .`, breaking the Vite build. dist is rebuilt in-image.
node_modules
dist
.vite
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*
